Blockquote lazy continuation stops at a fenced block

````
> ```
> a
b
> c
.
<blockquote>
  <pre><code>a
</code></pre>
</blockquote>
<p>b</p>
<blockquote><p>c</p></blockquote>
````

````
> text
> ```
lazy
.
<blockquote>
  <p>text</p>
  <pre><code></code></pre>
</blockquote>
<p>lazy</p>
````

````
> ```
code no marker
> still
.
<blockquote>
  <pre><code></code></pre>
</blockquote>
<p>code no marker</p>
<blockquote><p>still</p></blockquote>
````
